From bf93ec44c93d3836094d5cbc7b4e6a4c267a34c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:16:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/23] feat(web): let users verify email and fix a wrong phone
 in account bindings

An unverified email had no action in the bindings panel even though only
verified channels can be exchanged; when email OTP is configured a
one-time code now verifies it in place. The phone form no longer locks
up after a code is sent to a mistyped number: a change-number button and
a cancel toggle reset the flow. Also drop dead error-branch and unused
copy.
